---
source: crates/dd-spec/tests/fixtures.rs
expression: "dd_spec::diag::render_plain(&report.diagnostics, &name, &src)"
input_file: spec/fixtures/invalid/14-bad-command-name.yaml
---
DD-S005 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-S005)

  × `ReadTemp` is not a valid name in `commands`
    ╭─[14-bad-command-name.yaml:27:3]
 26 │ commands:
 27 │   ReadTemp:
    ·   ────┬───
    ·       ╰── invalid name
 28 │     send:   { header: 0x10 }
    ╰────
  help: names use lower_snake_case: a lower-case letter first, then letters, digits or `_`
DD-L007 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L007)

  × unknown command `read_temp`
    ╭─[14-bad-command-name.yaml:51:56]
 50 │ expose:
 51 │   - { class: sensor.temperature, channel: temp0, read: read_temp.celsius }
    ·                                                        ────────┬────────
    ·                                                                ╰── not declared
 52 │   - { class: light.indicator,    channel: led0,  write: set_led }
    ╰────
  help: did you mean `ReadTemp`?
DD-L008 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L008)

  × unknown command `read_temp`
    ╭─[14-bad-command-name.yaml:54:37]
 53 │ tests:
 54 │   - { name: room_temperature, call: read_temp, expect: { celsius: { between: [5, 45] } } }
    ·                                     ────┬────
    ·                                         ╰── not declared
 55 │   - { name: led_cap, call: set_led, args: { enabled: true, level: 90 }, expect: rejected_by_safety }
    ╰────
  help: did you mean `ReadTemp`?
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[14-bad-command-name.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
